===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl2=peritonea}}

# {{anatomy}} In [[mammal]]s, the [[serous]] membrane lining the cavity of the abdomen and that is folded over the [[viscera]].
# {{zoology}} In [[animal]]s, the membrane lining the [[coelom]] cavity.

